{"name": "Ikarus Parkour", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"30\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167280/extras/2c9407f12395dfe3deb67e644e109cc1.webp?t=1774576883\" width=\"295\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An immersive precision 3D platformer set within a deadly game show, hosted by the Elites for their twisted entertainment. Contestants, who voluntarily sign up, are transported to an 850-meter vertical tower, buried deep underground in an unknown location.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167280/extras/d9c96f12b2bea2f4aea0ff9bf3ec9466.poster.avif?t=1774576883\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167280/extras/d9c96f12b2bea2f4aea0ff9bf3ec9466.webm?t=1774576883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167280/extras/d9c96f12b2bea2f4aea0ff9bf3ec9466.mp4?t=1774576883\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"40\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167280/extras/b7b694a163340d2dc598cd79c9cc3374.webp?t=1774576883\" width=\"458\"/></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hard Mode</strong> -\u00a0no checkpoints and a speedrun timer</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Casual Mode </strong>-\u00a0frequent checkpoints and no timer.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167280/extras_big/b312069162b3d4693ae132fa01d264f6.avif?t=1774576883\" height=\"527\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167280/extras/b312069162b3d4693ae132fa01d264f6.avif?t=1774576883\" width=\"800\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"30\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167280/extras/a85ec4fda65b0fc92f3cd09fd49ca355.webp?t=1774576883\" width=\"295\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Reach the top to win a life-changing sum of money and your freedom. However, the stakes are as high as the tower itself\u2014fall, and it\u2019s the end. Every leap and maneuver is a matter of life and death. Can you survive the tower of Ikarus and escape?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167280/extras/ef0055c3ca4d902c5528f7fd630b185b.poster.avif?t=1774576883\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167280/extras/ef0055c3ca4d902c5528f7fd630b185b.webm?t=1774576883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167280/extras/ef0055c3ca4d902c5528f7fd630b185b.mp4?t=1774576883\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"30\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167280/extras/4def5eab2a7d22c4ef4ff75ee0977b82.webp?t=1774576883\" width=\"295\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the tower's deadly beauty,\u00a0an immense structure, split into four distinct levels, each with its own unique aesthetic, new obstacles and increased difficulty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Ikarus Parkour is a precision 3D platformer set within a deadly game show. Climb the massive 850-meter vertical tower, overcome its obstacles, and claim the fortune that awaits.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167280/header.jpg?t=1774576883", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["3D Platformer", "Parkour", "Difficult", "Dystopian", "Precision Platformer", "First-Person"], "developers": "Vanja Aleksi\u0107", "publishers": "Vanja Aleksi\u0107", "release_date": "Aug 1, 2025", "price": "$12.99", "appid": "3167280", "review_type": "Not Recommended", "curator_desc": "12 May 2025 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/xprD0ZZloZk", "first_seen": 1747008000.0, "review_rank": 1672}